## ---------------------------------------------------------------
## Project-specific: large training media
##
## Training_Deliverables.zip is 353 MB — over GitHub's hard 100 MB
## per-file limit, so a push would be rejected. It is also just an
## archived copy of Training_Deliverables/, which IS tracked.
Training_Deliverables.zip

## Raw footage and render sources: 323 MB (218 MB footage + 94 MB
## hyperframes_videos). Each file is individually under 100 MB, but
## committing them bloats every future clone permanently and cannot be
## undone without rewriting history. The finished deliverables in
## 2_VIDEOS/, 1_PPTS/ and 3_SCRIPTS/ ARE tracked.
## Delete these two lines if you want the raw media versioned instead.
Training_Deliverables/_reference/footage/
Training_Deliverables/_reference/hyperframes_videos/

# GSD Core install (reinstall: npx @opengsd/gsd-core@latest --claude --local).
# Its working plans in .planning/ ARE committed.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/.gsd-profile
.claude/.gsd-runtime
.claude/agents/gsd-*
.claude/commands/gsd-*
.claude/gsd-*
.claude/hooks/
.claude/scripts/

## Vendored HyperFrames skills (18 MB) — restorable from skills-lock.json,
## so the lock file is tracked and the fetched copies are not.
.agents/skills/
